      "notes": "[Crop Status] Big harvest day! Harvested many tomatoes and green beans (both actively producing). Harvested 3 potato plants (2 volunteer, 1 intentional) yielding 2 lbs 13 oz total of large tubers. Heights logged: Carrots (24\"), 1st Sow Beans (26\"), 2nd Sow Beans (18\"), Tomatoes (52\"), Potatoes (16\"), Corn (104\")."
