      "notes": "[Crop Status] Major heat-driven growth explosion logged across corn (67\"), cucumbers (64\"), and tomatoes (50\"). Potatoes showing flowers and potato berries, signaling transition to active underground tuber-bulking phase. First cucumbers harvested."
