      "tags": [
        "crop_corn",
        "crop_tomatoes",
        "crop_carrots"
      ],
      "notes": "[Crop Status] Audibled from fish fertilizer drench to dry pellet side-dressing due to restrictive mature crop canopy density. Completed targeted Coop Poop distributions across corn, tomatoes, and carrots."
